OL,3,GNEWSACalls for Jerriais on Jersey
OL,4,Astreet signs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are calls to put Jerriais on
OL,7,FJersey street signs to familiarise
OL,8,Fpeople with the native language and
OL,9,Ffoster a sense of island pride.
OL,11,FCarl Parslow, partner at Parslow's law
OL,12,Ffirm, said he wanted politicians to
OL,13,Fadopt the Welsh model where public
OL,14,Fsignage must be in both English and
OL,15,FWelsh, and place Jerriais alongside
OL,16,FEnglish.
OL,18,FIn 2019, the States Assembly agreed
OL,19,Fthat Jerriais should be incorporated
OL,20,Finto official States signs. However,
OL,21,Fthe language is absent on the new
OL,22,Fgovernment building.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
